\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Being of beings, God of love,
\par To Thee our hearts we raise:
\par Thy all-sustaining power we prove,
\par And gladly sing Thy praise.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Thine, wholly Thine, we long to be;
\par Our sacrifice receive:
\par Our sacrifice receive:
\par Made, and preserved, and saved by Thee,
\par To Thee ourselves we give.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Heavenward our every wish aspires;
\par For all Thy mercies' store,
\par The sole return Thy love requires
\par Is that we assk for more.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. For more we ask; we open then
\par Our hearts to embrace Thy will;
\par Turn, and revive us, Lord, again,
\par With all Thy fullness fill.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Come, Holy Ghost, the Saviour's love
\par Shed in our hearts abroad;
\par So shall we ever live, and move,
\par And be with Christ in God.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

